        <p class="article-date-published" itemprop="datePublished">02 Dec ’20</p>

        <p class="intro-excerpt" itemprop="description">2020 CIO Leaders in Alternative Investments Summit, Wharton Private Equity and Venture Capital Alumni Association | Virtual Event</p>

